---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Ref from '../components/Ref.astro';
import { actBy, cast } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title="Stranger Than Heaven Cast: All 17 Characters and Actors"
  description="Who plays whom in Stranger Than Heaven: Yu Shirota as Makoto Daito, Dean Fujioka, Snoop Dogg, Ado, Tori Kelly and the rest of the 17 named characters."
  path="/cast/"
>
  <h1>Cast and characters</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    SEGA has named {cast.length} characters so far. The cast mixes Japanese film actors with musicians from Japan and
    the United States <Ref ids="sega-0925" />.
  </p>

  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Character</th><th scope="col">Played by</th><th scope="col">Who they are</th><th scope="col">Where</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {cast.map((c) => (
          <tr id={c.id}>
            <th scope="row">{c.name}<span class="sub">{c.role}</span></th>
            <td>{c.performer}</td>
            <td>{c.about}</td>
            <td>{c.act ? <a href={`/acts/${actBy(c.act).slug}/`}>{actBy(c.act).city}, {actBy(c.act).year}</a> : <span class="muted">Not stated</span>}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="small muted">
    "Where" is filled in only when SEGA or Xbox has tied the character to a city. Descriptions are restated from the
    official character notes.
  </p>

  <h2>Two characters built from archive footage</h2>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Genzo Iwaki has the face of Bunta Sugawara, the Japanese film star who died in 2014. SEGA says the character is
      made in CG using archive footage from Toei, with the formal consent of his family, and is voiced by Takashi
      Ukaji <Ref ids={['sega-0507', 'sega-0925']} />.
    </p>
    <p>
      Amaru has the likeness of Tupac Shakur. SEGA says the studio is working with Amaru Entertainment, the company
      that manages his legacy, building the character in CG from archive footage and photographs, and not using AI.
      Who voices him has not been announced <Ref ids={['sega-0608', 'sega-0925']} />.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>The theme song</h2>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      The main theme shares the game's name. It is performed by Snoop Dogg, Satoshi Fujihara, Ado and Tori Kelly
      <Ref ids="sega-0507" />, and written by Tori Kelly and Satoshi Fujihara <Ref ids="xbox-0506" />. All four also
      play characters in the game.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>One voice track</h2>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      There is no separate English or Japanese dub to pick from. Characters speak whichever language fits the scene.
      Details are on the <a href="/release/">release page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Familiar voices</h2>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Takaya Kuroda, who has voiced Kazuma Kiryu since the first Yakuza game, plays the craftsman Takeo Godai. For how
      this game sits beside that series, see
      <a href="/like-a-dragon-connection/">the Like a Dragon connection</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
